<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>AI工具与模型HOT</title><link>https://ai-tool-model-hot.pages.dev/</link><description>每天从 19 个信源（16 个 RSS + 3 个 Hugging Face 组织页）收 AI 模型发布与主流智能体更新，按规则打分精选，只显示标题、一句简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:10:23 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>Gemini API 推出 Tool Retrieval：智能体工具按需加载</title><link>https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/gemini-api-tool-retrieval</link><description>Google 在 Gemini API 中推出 Tool Retrieval 预览版，让智能体把庞大工具库留在待命状态、只在需要时加载参数结构，从而省下输入 token 并保持工具选择的准确性。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b00f82b6db94c2e5b3b683ce3a1ae5d0e73a5a6b</guid><source url="https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/gemini-api-tool-retrieval">Google AI Blog</source></item><item><title>Gemini 4 Neon 上线 GitHub Copilot</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-18-gemini-4-neon-in-github-copilot</link><description>谷歌新一代模型 Gemini 4 Neon 正式登陆 GitHub Copilot，主打智能体编程、多步工具调用与知识工作。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:49:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f6cf8ded0e75bec96e1b678b6b93caefa289f4d3</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-18-gemini-4-neon-in-github-copilot">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>Claude Code 2.1.329</title><link>https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-329</link><description>2.1.329 版给钩子配置加了两处安全提醒：弹窗会说明钩子是在哪个文件夹声明的，非交互环境下也会提示受管设置中的钩子。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:20:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1c4ac2b04a513efc7a824c390f37ca8beb175f04</guid><source url="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-329">Claude Code Changelog</source></item><item><title>LangSmith Tool Gateway：为智能体提供安全、受治理的工具调用</title><link>https://www.langchain.com/blog/langsmith-tool-gateway</link><description>LangSmith 推出工具网关公开测试版，统一管理智能体每次工具调用的凭证、身份与权限，支持策略、审批与全链路追踪。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:00:01 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">48de2ffa10d67e095529c39e42490addedbe8189</guid><source url="https://www.langchain.com/blog/langsmith-tool-gateway">LangChain Blog</source></item><item><title>OpenAI Agents SDK v0.24.0</title><link>https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v0.24.0</link><description>Agents SDK 发布 0.24.0 版，统一运行级函数错误格式并新增 MCP 发现标注，同时改进故障恢复、沙箱安全与链路追踪。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:20:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f6af3e2f5c3e509526f2682898852981da3684a7</guid><source url="https://github.com/openai/openai-agents-python/releases/tag/v0.24.0">OpenAI Agents SDK Releases</source></item><item><title>Gemini 4 Neon 发布：前沿能力与执行速度兼顾的新成员</title><link>https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon</link><description>Gemini 4 家族的新成员，主打复杂编程、知识工作与科学任务的快速端到端完成，定位在 Carbon 与 Hydrogen 之间，兼顾前沿能力与成本效率，已在 Gemini API 与 AI Studio 上线。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:35:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b898a1b2127c5756e1c018cc6a81581a6294cda6</guid><source url="https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon">Google DeepMind Blog</source></item><item><title>Gemini 4 Neon 现已登陆 Devin</title><link>https://devin.ai/blog/gemini-4-neon</link><description>Devin 桌面版与命令行版现已支持 Gemini 4 Neon，该模型在 FrontierCode 2.0 基准上取得 46.2% 的成绩，是谷歌模型中的最佳表现，成本约为 Claude Opus 5.5 的三分之一。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2f0cb1ef8ee36bf8a11d74aee2bd4f9a9730101b</guid><source url="https://devin.ai/blog/gemini-4-neon">Devin Blog</source></item><item><title>Genie 4 现已上线</title><link>https://deepmind.google/blog/genie-4-is-now-available</link><description>DeepMind 的交互式世界模型 Genie 4 正式开放，可由文字或图像提示生成能够实时探索的互动世界。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 18:13:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">50e3ea47cbae988d3477f301b521889b55c9580b</guid><source url="https://deepmind.google/blog/genie-4-is-now-available">Google DeepMind Blog</source></item><item><title>DaisyRose-27B：推进后训练效率的前沿</title><link>https://huggingface.co/blog/RadixArk/daisyrose-27b-pushing-the-frontier-of-post-trainin</link><description>RadixArk 发布 27B 参数模型 DaisyRose，探索用更少的后训练投入换取更强的模型表现。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:54:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f689168723dc030df68e3b673ab44c5f35046795</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/RadixArk/daisyrose-27b-pushing-the-frontier-of-post-trainin">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>Claude Code 2.1.328 发布</title><link>https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-328</link><description>Claude Code 2.1.328 为 Opus 4.6 与 Sonnet 4.6 在 Bedrock、Google Cloud、Foundry 及应用网关上启用自动模式，免权限交互会话默认进入该模式。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:20:10 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">9d590322f684fa1fe551fc87f8b69c8f503722b7</guid><source url="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-328">Claude Code Changelog</source></item><item><title>LangSmith 面向编码智能体：按成果追踪花费</title><link>https://www.langchain.com/blog/langsmith-coding-agents-roi</link><description>LangSmith 为编码智能体新增报表能力，把智能体的花费与它产出的拉取请求挂钩，方便团队按实际成果衡量投入。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:00:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">6985c741cc7eaaabeaaf9f18e65ae45fa5f5acf9</guid><source url="https://www.langchain.com/blog/langsmith-coding-agents-roi">LangChain Blog</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v2.71.0 发布</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.71.0</link><description>Pydantic AI 2.71.0 版上线，改动集中在多智能体对等网络的连接方式与接口命名，并接入新的模型服务商 Stav。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 02:13:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">77770fa210de2552a66026b4560552e3450b3250</guid><source url="https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.71.0">Pydantic AI Releases</source></item><item><title>发布数据标注队列</title><link>https://www.langchain.com/blog/announcing-data-annotation-queue</link><description>用 LangSmith 的数据标注队列审阅日志、标注数据并沉淀数据集，让大模型应用从原型稳步走向生产。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:33:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">335c172adf129f6320dd27d101537fc81f313af7</guid><source url="https://www.langchain.com/blog/announcing-data-annotation-queue">LangChain Blog</source></item><item><title>为什么智能体治理要从可观测性开始</title><link>https://www.langchain.com/blog/agent-governance-observability</link><description>LangChain 认为，管好智能体的前提是先看清它在做什么：可观测性是治理的地基，而不是事后补救的手段。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:57:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">857e7e6fcb8c1e5dcb22caf8ee62c41b8197136b</guid><source url="https://www.langchain.com/blog/agent-governance-observability">LangChain Blog</source></item><item><title>Kiro Crew 推出 Conductor Mode</title><link>https://kiro.dev/blog/conductor-mode</link><description>Kiro Crew 的新模式让智能体像指挥一样并行推进功能开发，还能直接操作浏览器窗口，并在聊天中实时查看进度、测试完成的工作。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">84836a140068faa20c47c59e4b3b45f356c0d4a0</guid><source url="https://kiro.dev/blog/conductor-mode">Kiro Blog</source></item><item><title>为你的团队定制 GitHub Copilot</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-18-customize-github-copilot-for-your-team</link><description>团队定制功能正式面向组织团队开放，成员无需各自重复配置，即可共享团队常用的 Copilot 插件。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 16:00:13 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f9b17ed5db16e28ce5120e656f075832e401a446</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-18-customize-github-copilot-for-your-team">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>用 LangSmith Alerts 提前发现生产故障</title><link>https://www.langchain.com/blog/langsmith-alerts</link><description>为错误率、运行延迟和反馈评分设置实时通知，在用户察觉之前发现生产问题。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:33:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">48b8cce7f5510ef85847db4f873e5f79cb5532a1</guid><source url="https://www.langchain.com/blog/langsmith-alerts">LangChain Blog</source></item><item><title>Devin 面向 Databricks 迁移：少花时间迁移，多花时间构建</title><link>https://devin.ai/blog/devin-for-databricks-migrations</link><description>Devin 与 Databricks 合作，帮助企业更快地从传统数据平台迁移出来，让工程团队把更多时间花在用数据做开发上。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">c447f9907a84582bbff95f815e088d45b51993bc</guid><source url="https://devin.ai/blog/devin-for-databricks-migrations">Devin Blog</source></item><item><title>用 Devin Security 的 Threats 功能排查 NGINX2Root 与 Java4Shell 漏洞</title><link>https://devin.ai/blog/nginx2root-java4shell-threats</link><description>Devin Security 新增漏洞扫描能力，可帮客户发现并修补近期披露的 NGINX2Root 与 Java4Shell 两个高危漏洞。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 23:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">7ff45e0686057773eaa06ad8ad533aa2dec3104f</guid><source url="https://devin.ai/blog/nginx2root-java4shell-threats">Devin Blog</source></item><item><title>部署 Daybreak Red：有监督安全调查的参考架构</title><link>https://openai.com/business/learn/deploying-daybreak-red</link><description>OpenAI 介绍 Daybreak Red 参考架构，说明如何搭建一套带安全控制与监控的有监督安全调查流程。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">4b08ec50268e04a4eb3cb57ed8baf78fd82cefe6</guid><source url="https://openai.com/business/learn/deploying-daybreak-red">OpenAI News</source></item></channel></rss>
